# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CitySample asset migration (2026-09-23)
#
# The City Sample PCG art + graphs were copied in so they can be reused here.
# They are NOT tracked by git: the payload is ~63 GB across ~26k files, and 48
# individual files exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit (largest is 719 MB), so a
# normal commit cannot carry it and no git-lfs is configured in this repo.
#
# The content lives on disk and is regenerated by:
#     Tools/sync-citysample-assets.ps1
# which robocopies from E:\CitySample 5.8 and is byte-exact (verified).
#
# Tracked instead: the 27 building style assets and the 18 city graphs are
# small enough to live in the CitySamplePCG plugin, but its whole Content/ is
# excluded below for the same size reason.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/Content/AI/
/Content/Audio/
/Content/Building/
/Content/Character/
/Content/Cinematics/
/Content/City/
/Content/Crowd/
/Content/Effect/
/Content/Environment/
/Content/Gameplay/
/Content/HDA/
/Content/Lighting/
/Content/Localization/
/Content/Lookdev/
/Content/Map/
/Content/Material/
/Content/Megascans/
/Content/MSPresets/
/Content/Prop/
/Content/Road/
/Content/Splash/
/Content/Textures/
/Content/UI/
/Content/Vehicle/
/Content/WFC/
# __ExternalActors__ is level-scoped. Our own four levels' external actors must
# stay tracked so future saves remain committable; the imported CitySample ones
# (under Map/) belong to levels that are not part of this project's gameplay.
/Content/__ExternalActors__/*
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/ThirdPerson/
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_Combat/
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_Platforming/
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_SideScrolling/
!/Content/__ExternalActors__/PCGArea/
/Content/__ExternalObjects__/
/Plugins/CitySamplePCG/Content/

# Stray CitySample root-level file pulled in with the art copy. It belongs to
# CitySample's own startup map, which is not part of this project's gameplay.
/Content/StartMapTextRender.uasset

# Six test assets the previous session created and could not delete through the
# asset system (delete_asset returned False for them). Not tracked. Remove them
# by hand from the Content Browser when convenient.
/Content/PCGTest/

# SDD workspace: per-plan ledger and briefs for the executing-plans skill. Scratch,
# not deliverable — regenerated by task-start/task-done.
/.superpowers/

# The derived level's own external actors are tracked (see the exceptions above), but ONE of
# them is 288 MB and GitHub refuses any single file over 100 MB, so it cannot be committed.
# Git cannot express "over N bytes", and the path below is stable because the actor GUID is.
# Its absence means the committed level opens WITHOUT that actor's content -- disclosed in
# docs/pcg-small-area-18-stage-report.html rather than silently dropped.
/Content/__ExternalActors__/PCGArea/L_SmallArea18/9/XW/KWSOA4XANOW11ZD5MZYXGU.uasset
